R -> 4
W -> 2
X -> 1

touch aws
chmod ugo+w aws
chmod o-w aws
chmod ugo+rwx aws
chmod 700 aws

change ownership
----------------
cd /tmp
touch aws.txt (Having ec2-user as owner)
sudo useradd suresh (we need to change ownership aws.txt to suresh)
sudo chown suresh aws.txt (To change owner)
sudo chown suresh:suresh aws.txt (To change group and user of the file)
